  "summary": "The fit pilot takes over with \"I HAVE CONTROL\" and secures the flight path. If the incapacitated pilot interferes with the controls, press the sidestick pb for 40 s. Declare the emergency to ATC, call the purser to help contain the incapacitated pilot, reduce the workload, and land at the nearest suitable airport with medical assistance arranged.",
